    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "INTERNAL MEMO #96291\n\nThe Occasus has been very helpful in their efforts to bring us more biomass. This is something that we could not have done alone - and as mercenaries of a sort, they are exceedingly useful so long as they believe the are the ones using us, and not the other way around. Their organisation has its blind spots, but so do we all.",
    "value": "内部备忘录 #96291\n\n“陨日”的努力一直很有助益，他们为我们带来了更多生物质。这是单靠我们无法完成的事情 - 作为某种形式的雇佣兵，只要他们相信是他们在利用我们，而非相反，他们就极其有用。他们的组织自有其盲点，但我们亦然。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "After the setback on the moon laboratory Zeta Cygnus II, we've upped our containment systems and procedures. We're careful to not let any Occasus members have too high clearance, and to have all our engineers check their suggestions for security backdoors. Their help has been useful, but we should not overrely on such.",
    "value": "在月球实验室泽塔·天鹅座II号遭遇挫折后，我们已升级了收容系统与流程。我们谨慎行事，不让任何“陨日”成员拥有过高的权限级别，并让我们所有的工程师核查他们关于安全后门的建议。他们的帮助是有用的，但我们也不应过度依赖此类援助。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "These human supremacists think that they can borrow our expertise and then throw us away when we're no longer needed. Amateurs. The Hylotl have had countless generations to hone the shiv of our superiority.",
